Latest validated checkpoint: 1,111 tests passed, one legacy test ignored; native acceptance completed 819 frames with three server-confirmed actions and zero audio errors.

[B][SIZE=4]Still in development[/SIZE][/B]

Broader rendering and occlusion, session recovery, gameplay coverage and sustained stability remain active work. Feedback is welcome as client parity continues.

